>> w := ['A_bottle_of_Whisky and a rare steak.'].
Génn bind: ['=== Basic test, grab the bottle! ==='], taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:2 guddaay: 6), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:8 guddaay: -6), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:2 guddaay: 6), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:8 guddaay: -6), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['=== Take a single char ==='], taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:7 guddaay: 1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:7 guddaay: 1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['=== The 0 case, empty string ==='], taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:7 guddaay: 0), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:7 guddaay: 0), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['=== Edge case, first character only ==='], taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:0 guddaay: 1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:0 guddaay: 1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:1 guddaay: -1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:1 guddaay: -1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['=== Edge case, last character only ==='], taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:35 guddaay: 1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:35 guddaay: 1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:36 guddaay: -1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:36 guddaay: -1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['=== Out of bounds, empty string ==='], taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:36 guddaay: 37), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:36 guddaay: 47), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:-1 guddaay: -2), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:-2 guddaay: -1), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['=== Part out of bounds, full string ==='], taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:-20 guddaay: 90), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:90 guddaay: -20), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:-20 guddaay: 90), taxaw.
Génn bind: ['>']+(w duppitu dale:90 guddaay: -120), taxaw.
